  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can play your cards in such a way that they will be used when they are needed the most. You can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.dLgAMt3TbkmLkUqE]{Ready} with one action to do a @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.k9UB3L2ddh2b03Wb]{Standard Play} as a reaction with a trigger you designate. When you Ready to do a Standard Play, your Card leaves your hand as if it was Played. If the Reaction is not used by the time your turn begins, the Card is lost.</p>"
    },
